<topic id="GUID-2D0FB25D-4B42-4793-B3A7-B1B1CBECA14B" xml:lang="en-US"> 
  <title>Client Sustain T-Sensor Calculator</title> 
  <body> 
	 <p> The Client Sustain T-Sensor Calculator (#<xref href="https://cdrdv2.intel.com/v1/dl/getContent/860647" format="https" scope="external">860647</xref>) can be used to calculate the sustained T-sensor value by using custom inputs from the below mentioned values in the table. 
	 </p> 
	 <fig id="FIG_D5CBDF04022A454E8BB2586A7D84BC0A"><image href="../images/GUID-10B631D4-FAE0-48DF-98FD-86C5B8A863E8.png" scalefit="yes" id="IMAGE_809121B98B2A4094ADC7EB9BE9305DE2"> 
		  <alt> 
		  </alt></image> 
	 </fig> 
	 <p> Following case can be used as initial reference for cooling needs and density factor (Sustained PL1) usage: 
	 </p> 
	 <table id="GUID-52512DB1-77EA-46AA-A2CB-A4C785B55D20"> 
		<tgroup cols="1"><colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="*" /> 
		  <thead> 
			 <row> 
				<entry colname="col1" valign="middle" align="center"> 
				  <b>Scenario 1</b> 
				</entry> 
			 </row></thead> 
		  <tbody> 
			 <row> 
				<entry colname="col1"> 
				  <ul id="GUID-0D583674-448F-447E-B3B0-2C2CF67A8E65"> 
					 <li id="LI_9B62651A7BC64471BB514F65707858D4"> T<sub>amb</sub> - 35 °C, T<sub>sys</sub> -11 °C, PL1-45W 
					 </li> 
					 <li id="LI_F905506DC6984BC4B2B57B67D2D3ADC6">Assume, PTL: Ψ<sub>hp-a</sub> - 0.36 [°C/W]; (iso thermal solution b/w PTL and NVL) 
					 </li> 
					 <li id="LI_21470BCE91DD48E089EE402728109A53">PTL and NVL resistance considered (refer section) as below: 
						<ul id="GUID-880256F7-D060-4EE9-85C6-60D0FF5C1854"> 
						  <li id="LI_94ECB680A6AE4258B7A350F1DC2D133F">PTL-H 484 4X<sup>e</sup>: Ψ<sub>sn-hp</sub> - 0.84 [°C/W] 
						  </li> 
						  <li id="LI_16E0A1D8855C4E4C8DB645644647FB6E">NVL 16C: Ψ<sub>sn-hp</sub> - 0.63 [°C/W] 
						  </li> 
						</ul> 
					 </li> 
					 <li id="LI_DAEF22E911A3462699CE59DF7534C91A">Use 
						<b>Equation 1</b> to find T<sub>sn</sub> for PTL and NVL 
						<p> 
						  <b>PTL-H 484 T<sub>sn</sub> : 100 °C; NVL 16C T<sub>sn</sub> : 90.6 °C 
						  </b> 
						</p> 
					 </li> 
				  </ul> 
				</entry> 
			 </row> 
			 <row> 
				<entry colname="col1"> 
				  <p> 
					 <b>Equation 1</b> 
				  </p> 
				  <p> Ψ<sub>sn - a</sub> = Ψ<sub>hp-a</sub> + Ψ<sub>sn -hp</sub>; T<sub>sn</sub> = [ Ψ<sub>sn</sub> - a * PL1] + T<sub>sys</sub> +T<sub>amb</sub> 
				  </p> 
				</entry> 
			 </row> 
			 <row> 
				<entry colname="col1"> 
				  <note id="GUID-EDE8BBAC-2CBB-43FC-A856-ECC069A5439C"> This is a first order calculation and needs to be verified through simulation or test. For performing calculations with custom inputs, refer to the Client Sustain T-Sensor Calculator (#<xref href="https://cdrdv2.intel.com/v1/dl/getContent/860647" format="https" scope="external">860647</xref>). 
				  </note> 
				</entry> 
			 </row> 
		  </tbody> 
		</tgroup> 
	 </table> 
